&lt;li&gt;Partner with our account executives to articulate the overall Arize value proposition, vision, and strategy to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with some of the most sophisticated GenAI teams in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will act as a trusted advisor to our prospective customers, while also building relationships with technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product demonstrations of the Arize platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on GenAI and ML best practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery to understand prospect’s GenAI tech stack to collaborate with the Sales team to construct a compelling value proposition of the Arize Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Proof of Concept (PoC) motions with prospective buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle technical objections and develop strategies across sales, engineering, and product to unblock them&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
