&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Even if you do not check every single box, we still encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a customer-facing role such as sales engineer, solutions engineer, or forward deployed engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills: Ability to simplify complex, technical concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python / Typescript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of LLM / Agentic frameworks such as OpenAI Agents SDK, Google ADK, LangGraph, and DSPy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of GenAI concepts and application evaluation + development lifecycle&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A quick and self learner - undaunted by technical complexity of production AI deployments and welcome the challenge to learn about them and develop your own POV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points, But Not Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience working across and aligning Sales, Product, and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience within a team that underwent a high growth stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous engineering experience in: Data Engineering, MLOps, Kubernetes, GCP / AWS / Azure&lt;/li&gt;
