&lt;li&gt;Build out Claude code and Cursor skills for automating systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the growth marketing experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the “voice of the AI engineer” across Arize’s base of users and the AI developer community at large&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a product advocate for Arize&#39;s core SaaS or OSS offerings. Distill market insights and developer feedback to inform roadmap and GTM activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft best practices and novel perspectives on troubleshooting and improving production ML models and LLM-powered applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and speak at Arize-hosted and industry events and conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
