&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of generative AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical experience with the LLM app development stack (e.g. agents, orchestration frameworks, vector databases, evaluation libraries) with proficiency in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaged in technical communities via GitHub, Medium, DZone, Stack Overflow, Reddit, LinkedIn, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
